start: mr
R1: {3ch=tr 2ch [3tr 2ch]x3 2tr}@ring ss@top
R2: ss@sp 3ch=tr 2ch {3tr ch}@same [{3tr 2ch 3tr ch}@sp]x3 2tr@same ss@top fo
